meta {
  name: 5 mcp-splunk
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  
  Publishes no port. Reach it from inside soc-ai_soc-network — use the `docker`
  environment — or add a `ports:` mapping while testing.
  
  Stateless, so a single JSON-RPC POST works with no initialize handshake.
  Replies arrive as SSE: `event: message` then `data: {json}`.
}
